      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, I strongly advise against taking propranolol without consulting your healthcare provider. Propranolol can have significant interactions with other medications, including those used to manage asthma symptoms, and may not be suitable for everyone. I suggest practicing deep breathing exercises or other relaxation techniques to help manage your anxiety. If you're struggling, reach out to a mental health professional or a trusted friend/family member for support. It's very important not to self-medicate, especially with a schedule change in hand.",
